{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-local-omission.md","title":"Local Realization and Omission over a Theory","display":"df-local-omission — Local Realization and Omission over a Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-local-omission","aliases":["17-df-local-omission"],"display":"df-local-omission — Local Realization and Omission over a Theory","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"2.2","source_result":"Local realization and local omission definitions before Proposition 2.2.8","source_pages_print":[79,80],"source_pages_djvu":[95,96],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; explicit finite arity and semantic consistency witness","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-complete-formula]]","[[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-local-omission"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-local-omission</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-omission — Local Realization and Omission over a Theory"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local realization and local omission definitions before Proposition 2.2.8"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>79</span><span>80</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>95</span><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; explicit finite arity and semantic consistency witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"401bc4f750ae4719\" href=\"?note=401bc4f750ae4719\" title=\"17-df-complete-formula\">17-df-complete-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e1c067a42f0c312e\" href=\"?note=e1c067a42f0c312e\" title=\"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets\">17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e1c067a42f0c312e\" href=\"?note=e1c067a42f0c312e\" title=\"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets\">17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\models_T\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\models_T\\psi\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"401bc4f750ae4719\" href=\"?note=401bc4f750ae4719\" title=\"17-df-complete-formula\">17-df-complete-formula</a> 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}\\)</span>；语言由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的指定语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\{\\varphi\\})\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\varphi\\models_T\\psi)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\neg\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\{\\varphi\\})\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\varphi\\models_T\\psi)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\neg\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书要求局部实现的见证公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致，因此不可用矛盾公式作为空洞见证。按经典量词否定，局部省略等价于：对每个与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\Sigma\">\\(\\psi\\in\\Sigma\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致。这个等价形式是原书 Henkin 构造每步保持一致性的条件。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 不一致，局部实现恒假而局部省略恒真；因此存在省略模型的定理必须另列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致。理论无需完备，公式集也无需是完整型。对完整型，局部实现与 Stone 孤立性相同，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"de5d3e9530a68ea0\" href=\"?note=de5d3e9530a68ea0\" title=\"17-df-non-isolated-types\">17-df-non-isolated-types</a> 的局部推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-complete-formula","status":"resolved","id":"401bc4f750ae4719","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-complete-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets","status":"resolved","id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets","status":"resolved","id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-complete-formula","status":"resolved","id":"401bc4f750ae4719","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-non-isolated-types","status":"resolved","id":"de5d3e9530a68ea0","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若 $T$ 不一致，局部实现恒假而局部省略恒真；因此存在省略模型的定理必须另列 $T$ 一致。理论无需完备，公式集也无需是完整型。对完整型，局部实现与 Stone 孤立性相同，见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]] 的局部推导。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\models_T\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\{\\varphi\\})\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\varphi\\models_T\\psi)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\neg\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}(\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2364,"backlinks":[{"id":"a628b44ab2781524","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\models_T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ 见 [[17-df-complete-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Atomic}_T$ 见 [[17-df-atomic-model]]。实现公式集谓词 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。证明使用 [[17-df-local-omission]] 的局部省略及 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，